  "Depuis {y}, le S&P 500 a monté {p} % des jours. À très court terme, personne ne sait : ni vous, ni les experts, ni ce site.": "Since {y}, the S&P 500 rose on {p}% of days. In the very short term nobody knows: not you, not the experts, not this site.",
  "Sur 20 ans, le temps joue pour vous.": "Over 20 years, time works for you.",
  "{p} % des périodes de 20 ans ont fini en gain, dividendes non compris. On ne s’enrichit pas en un jour, mais en restant investi longtemps.": "{p}% of 20-year periods ended with a gain, dividends excluded. You don't get rich in a day, but by staying invested for a long time.",
